#: packs/integrations/claude-code/README.md
msgid ""
"Anthropic's coding agent for the terminal (`claude`), installed into your home folder"
msgstr ""
"El agente de programación de Anthropic para la terminal (`claude`), instalado en tu carpeta personal"

#: packs/integrations/claude-code/README.md
msgid ""
"Anthropic's installer needs no admin rights and supports the Frame's ARM processor, and it puts everything in your home folder, so SteamOS updates leave it alone."
msgstr ""
"El instalador de Anthropic no necesita permisos de administrador, es compatible con el procesador ARM del Frame y pone todo en tu carpeta personal, así que las actualizaciones de SteamOS no lo tocan."

#: packs/integrations/claude-code/README.md
msgid "Claude Code (command line)"
msgstr "Claude Code (línea de comandos)"

#: packs/integrations/claude-code/README.md
msgid ""
"Claude Code, Anthropic's coding agent for the terminal (`claude`), installed with Anthropic's own installer."
msgstr ""
"Claude Code, el agente de programación de Anthropic para la terminal (`claude`), instalado con el instalador oficial de Anthropic."

#: packs/integrations/claude-code/install.sh:11
msgid "Couldn't download Anthropic's installer."
msgstr "No se pudo descargar el instalador de Anthropic."

#: packs/integrations/claude-code/install.sh:12
msgid "Anthropic's installer failed (see above)."
msgstr "El instalador de Anthropic falló (ver arriba)."

#: packs/integrations/claude-code/install.sh:13
msgid ""
"Done. Open a terminal (Konsole) and run: claude\n"
"The first run asks you to log in with your Claude account in a browser."
msgstr ""
"Listo. Abre una terminal (Konsole) y ejecuta: claude\n"
"La primera vez te pide iniciar sesión con tu cuenta de Claude en un navegador."

#: packs/integrations/claude-code/install.sh:6
