#: packs/integrations/claude-desktop/README.md
msgid ""
"Anthropic ships it as an apt package for Ubuntu and Debian. SteamOS has no apt and its system files are read-only, so this unpacks the package into your home folder instead."
msgstr ""
"Anthropic lo distribuye como paquete apt para Ubuntu y Debian. SteamOS no tiene apt y sus archivos del sistema son de solo lectura, así que esto desempaqueta el paquete en tu carpeta personal."

#: packs/integrations/claude-desktop/README.md
msgid ""
"Anthropic's Claude Desktop app for Linux (arm64), installed without apt"
msgstr ""
"La app Claude para escritorio de Anthropic para Linux (arm64), instalada sin apt"

#: packs/integrations/claude-desktop/README.md
msgid "Claude Desktop"
msgstr "Claude para escritorio"

#: packs/integrations/claude-desktop/README.md
msgid ""
"Claude Desktop, Anthropic's official Linux app (arm64), installed into your home folder and updated with one command."
msgstr ""
"Claude para escritorio, la app oficial de Anthropic para Linux (arm64), instalada en tu carpeta personal y actualizada con un solo comando."

